    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/3fe67517c1d2c4c2a911b92de5733f85.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><br>One day, country-man Bell receives a letter from his dearest friend: Lumia. She left their hometown to fulfill her greatest dream: Becoming a singer, a popular idol bringing love and hope to people all around the world. Attached to the letter is a ticket for her next concert, an unspoken invitation to come and visit her in person. <br><br>Bell takes the long journey by ship, given five days\u2019 time before the next ship will return him back home again. Five days for one love, Bell has to make every day count if he wants his own dream to become reality: For Lumia to accept his confession.<br><br>He isn\u2019t alone in his quest though, with Lumia\u2019s beauty being as alluring as her voice, her body and heart are sought after by other people as well. If he doesn\u2019t act fast enough, someone else might steal her away right in front of his eyes...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/3792e8353e8d4caa17e3f13e570bcee7.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/4972514496861e67de6c3afe1e13a00a.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=675 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/df0cf76ef1dbca441263c59af2589811.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><br>You play as Bell, having five days to make the best out of your visit before a return ship will take you back home again. During this time, you can freely roam through the cozy port town of Loft, go on dates with Lumia, watch her perform on stage or peep on whatever she might be doing behind closed curtains\u2026<br><br>Whether you strive for pure or tainted love, for romance or heartbreak, the various possible routes cover a wide range of kinks. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/3fd6255d014fad5786de8c5c92372672.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achievements: Track your progress via a number of achievements both in the game and as Steam Achievements!<br></li><li>A day and night cycle: Time advances during events and by entering and leaving buildings, from morning to evening to night and midnight. Time can also be advanced manually, with different events happening at different times of the day. <br></li><li>Multiple endings: Will the love between Bell and Lumia deepen or will their bond of former days wilt in the embrace of someone else? Your decisions will determine their future.<br></li><li>Disbird: It might be wise of Bell to check this social-messaging app for the latest news about a certain, popular girl in town\u2026 <br></li><li>Reminiscence room: Every naughty scene can be replayed again in the reminiscence room for a comfortable experience \u2013 including Lumia\u2019s point of view and a full-unlock switch!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/3fe67517c1d2c4c2a911b92de5733f85.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><br>One day, country-man Bell receives a letter from his dearest friend: Lumia. She left their hometown to fulfill her greatest dream: Becoming a singer, a popular idol bringing love and hope to people all around the world. Attached to the letter is a ticket for her next concert, an unspoken invitation to come and visit her in person. <br><br>Bell takes the long journey by ship, given five days\u2019 time before the next ship will return him back home again. Five days for one love, Bell has to make every day count if he wants his own dream to become reality: For Lumia to accept his confession.<br><br>He isn\u2019t alone in his quest though, with Lumia\u2019s beauty being as alluring as her voice, her body and heart are sought after by other people as well. If he doesn\u2019t act fast enough, someone else might steal her away right in front of his eyes...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/3792e8353e8d4caa17e3f13e570bcee7.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/4972514496861e67de6c3afe1e13a00a.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=675 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/df0cf76ef1dbca441263c59af2589811.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><br>You play as Bell, having five days to make the best out of your visit before a return ship will take you back home again. During this time, you can freely roam through the cozy port town of Loft, go on dates with Lumia, watch her perform on stage or peep on whatever she might be doing behind closed curtains\u2026<br><br>Whether you strive for pure or tainted love, for romance or heartbreak, the various possible routes cover a wide range of kinks. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919130/extras/3fd6255d014fad5786de8c5c92372672.avif?t=1755275400\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achievements: Track your progress via a number of achievements both in the game and as Steam Achievements!<br></li><li>A day and night cycle: Time advances during events and by entering and leaving buildings, from morning to evening to night and midnight. Time can also be advanced manually, with different events happening at different times of the day. <br></li><li>Multiple endings: Will the love between Bell and Lumia deepen or will their bond of former days wilt in the embrace of someone else? Your decisions will determine their future.<br></li><li>Disbird: It might be wise of Bell to check this social-messaging app for the latest news about a certain, popular girl in town\u2026 <br></li><li>Reminiscence room: Every naughty scene can be replayed again in the reminiscence room for a comfortable experience \u2013 including Lumia\u2019s point of view and a full-unlock switch!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Five days. That\u2019s all the time Bell has to confess his true feelings to Lumia, beautiful singer and love of his life. She left their hometown in pursuit of her dreams \u2013 can Bell become a part of her dreams, or will someone else charm Lumia's heart? Let the countdown begin!",
